#10503
Beach Road~
   This path is extremely well kept.  Small stones line its edges, and
the sand of the beach has been laid down and somehow melted into a hard,
glassy surface.  Palm trees crowd every inch of ground outside the path,
and strange noises and blood-chilling screams fill the air.  It is very
dark here.  The path leads on to the east, and a strange mound lies to
the west.
~
