#10504
Harem~
   This chamber is full of imported finery: lavish rugs, priceless
vases, and piles of money and jewelry heaped everywhere.  Silent women
in silk gowns move about in a mechanical dance, their eyes empty, as if
under some spell.  Over all the racket, a harsh voice can be heard
shouting, "Keep working!"  The way out lies up.
~
