#10506
Creepy Road~
   You're not quite sure why, but this road sends shivers down your
spine.  Perhaps it's the total and complete silence; not a bird sings,
not a leaf stirs.  Or perhaps it's the skeletons strewn haphazardly
along the roadside, bleached white by the sun.  You just don't know.
The road runs east and west.
~
