#10527
Boiling Tar Pit~
   As you set one foot into the goo, it sticks.  You try to pull it out
but lose your balance, and the other foot gets stuck as well.  Try as
you might, you cannot free them!  Each sinks lower and lower until your
legs are encased in the boiling pit.  You scream for help, but none
comes, and you scream until your head finally sinks beneath the goo and
you can breathe no more.  So sorry!  You have suffocated to death.
~
105 cj 2
S
