#10529
High Path~
   This road is amazingly well built, paved with some black, onyx-like
stone shined to a mirror gleam, and lined with bricks of the same stuff
fitted so tightly that not even a sheet of paper could slip between
them.  The trees have been trimmed back to allow easy passage.  Even
amid all this beauty, you sense a sinister presence.  The road leads
east and south.
~
