#10530
Trail of Terror~
   This trail runs beneath the skeletal ribs of some huge creature,
arching overhead like a diabolical canopy.  You can hear... drums?  Some
pulsing beat in the distance, and a soft chanting farther off still, but
you see no sign of life.  Loneliness grips you, and panic is not far
behind.  The trail leads south and west.
~
