   You are at an extremely odd dock, raised high on stilts on one side
to keep you from falling off a cliff.  Netting begins to the south,
strung through the treetops, and far below to the south lies a large tar
pit; good thing there is netting to keep you from falling into it.  The
dock juts out to the north.
~
