#10591
Hall of Wax~
   Gory statues line this hall, depicting every kind of torture, from
the most mundane iron-maiden experience to the more imaginative things
one can do with a cat-o'-nine-tails and razors.  What makes them most
uncomfortable to look at is that they are made of wax, and so lifelike
that you can almost see them screaming in terror.  Did one move?  No, it
must be your mind playing tricks on you.  The way leads north.
~
