#10592
Entrance to the Office of the High Priest of Terror~
   This is certainly not your average office.  Perhaps it is the skulls
lined up on spikes around the room that give it away, or the fact that
it seems to open into several other rooms.  You really don't want to be
here.  A door leads north, and a passage south; neither way looks very
comforting.
