#10593
Hall of Torture~
   This certainly isn't the entrance to the office... how does one get
back?  You feel turned around.  As you look about, you are overcome with
nausea, and you immediately realize that you shouldn't have looked:
instruments of torture lie everywhere, some of which you never imagined
could have been invented, and certainly not by a sane person.  You can
go east (oh, so that's the way back to the entrance) or south into
another chamber.
~
