#10594
Hall of Death~
   Dead bodies lie strewn about this hall, apparently killed by the
devices in the Hall of Torture.  They are so mangled that you cannot
tell whether they were human or something else, and you certainly don't
want to think about it for long.  You can leave by a door north to the
Hall of Torture, east to the Temple of Terror, or through a door south
to the office of the High Priest.
~
