#10597
Entrance to the Temple of Terror~
   The entrance to this temple is blinding; that is its most notable
feature.  Flashes of light burst from a globe in the center of the room,
and the walls, made of a metal that reflects light like a mirror only
brighter, throw them back a thousandfold.  You can go north through a
door to the strange trail, or east into the temple.
~
