#10599
Shrine to Vice~
   This small shrine holds nothing but an altar and a small book bearing
the inscription: "You cannot take that which is not yours... but you can
have as much of it as you want."  You think you hear maniacal cackling
somewhere nearby, but when you turn, you see nothing.  The hallway lies
to the south.
~
